l flour and Pea flour. All ingredients have been tested for Glyphosate by 3rd party testing facilities and have been found to be Glyphosate free. You can see the test <a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0814/9601/5123/files/SimpleLab_Report_FMY67B.pdf?v=1772901079"><u>here</u></a> </p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="e8c51c92-391f-4e07-84a8-6afde0a4213c" class="r-1txoody" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="0e2aa9a7-1510-4186-a859-e0573176c3a9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7jlfb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1ib4lrp"><div data-rid="be648dca-3289-4c8d-b407-69b9df22e70b" class="r-1an2zic alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Directions</p></span></div><div data-rid="bfcaa31a-1e12-4c96-8456-809d3faf91aa" class="r-j43sxy" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-plus-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R7jlfb2:"><div data-rid="127f7c48-bbee-43aa-acdc-3557ef7c384f" class="r-utgy7q"><div data-rid="c99b3e00-25d6-47ce-8fc8-c57d2b635560" class="r-12boplu alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><ol><li><p>Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil.</p></li><li><p>Add 1 box of Boostcous and stir well. Some foaming is normal.<br></p></li><li><p>Reduce to simmer and cook for 5-7 minutes depending on your desired firmness.</p></li><li><p>Strain well, rinse with warm water and serve with your favorite dish! Enjoy!</p></li></ol><p><br></p><p>Boostcous cooks in anywhere from 5-7 minutes. Make sure you boil in generously salted water, and do not overcook!&nbsp; Please experiment with cooking times to find the right cooking time for you and your family. It's important to rinse the Couscous after draining the water and to make sure to not overcook the Couscous</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="63f484fe-9279-4007-bc0b-f93b8036cd33" class="r-193jeug" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="b3812d12-2636-4772-9496-09d4ed06b327" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9jlfb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-15oota4"><div data-rid="c40ce705-c736-4ed2-8fc4-1c2d40a576f6" class="r-lg4uk1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Benefits</p></span></div><div data-rid="111c894b-f902-4428-a417-5fa91f11e1c5" class="r-1u084uw" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-plus-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R9jlfb2:"><div data-rid="df952f3b-9ecf-4ecf-8f99-5dbfe53061d3" class="r-du1gby"><div data-rid="4957b8c2-9f28-4f8d-a0e9-72f827b5b8f1" class="r-12knljw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The benefits of Boostcous make up a long list. Try saying all of this with one breath of air: gut health, recovery, strength building, curb hunger cravings, and overall health.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="45fbcbb5-62e1-42fc-b67a-548995c522cd" class="r-1ckxx83"><div data-rid="197f6201-7142-4a08-9bec-5ddc4b6dea6b" data-to